WEBVTT

00:55:57.728 --> 00:56:00.752
and let them then figure out
their own meaning to their lives

00:56:00.776 --> 00:56:04.057
and come away from work
as defining our meaning et cetera.

00:56:04.362 --> 00:56:05.910
You're really suggesting

00:56:05.934 --> 00:56:10.346
a much better idea is for societies
to invest much more

00:56:10.370 --> 00:56:14.815
in these human, compassion-fueled,
tech-empowered jobs.

00:56:14.839 --> 00:56:16.855
Do you see a route
that we could get there?

00:56:16.879 --> 00:56:19.124
KFL: Well, first, I think
universal basic income

00:56:19.148 --> 00:56:20.987
is potentially very dangerous,

00:56:21.011 --> 00:56:25.722
because if you provide everybody
with universal pay

00:56:25.746 --> 00:56:28.186
without having to contribute anything

00:56:28.210 --> 00:56:32.238
or be retrained or take on something new,